    "explanation": "In orbital combustion research, each ISS glovebox burn costs astronaut crew time and resupply mass, resulting in high-precision small-N tabular datasets (79 verified BASS-II state transitions). Instead of data-hungry black-box deep learning, our Physics-Informed Neural Network (PINN) embeds Olson Eq. (6.1) and Bhattacharjee Eq. (2.2)-(2.5) directly into the loss function, achieving high generalization accuracy without synthetic hallucination."
  },
